<?php
return ['name' => 'attuned_geng_metal_the_strategist', 'displayTitle' => ['en' => 'Attuned Geng Metal – The Strategist', 'zh' => '身弱庚金'], 'locales' => ['en' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Geng Metal is the element of the sword, yet in an attuned state its force is limited. Instead of raw power, Attuned Geng Metal shines through deep deliberation and strategic foresight. Attuned Geng Metal doesn\'t seek to brandish its blade for show; it focuses on becoming an irreplaceable problem-solver in its chosen arena. With precise judgment and careful planning, it can leverage even modest resources to create maximum impact, achieving steady and effective breakthroughs without needing loud glory.</p><p>Humble & Cautious: You present a modest, low‑key demeanor. Meticulous and prudent, you weigh pros and cons expertly – just guard against overthinking to the point of missing good opportunities.<br/>Principled & Steadfast: Though gentle on the surface, you have an inner backbone of steel. You refuse to compromise on core principles, sometimes struggling when lofty ideals collide with harsh realities.<br/>Sensitive & Loyal: You form deep commitments and keep your promises. However, you are wary of whom you trust; it often takes a long, steady relationship for you to truly let down your guard and open up emotionally.</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Earth and Metal. Think of yourself as steel newly forged – not yet hardened. You may lack a bit of confidence or stability at times. Earth energy grounds you and nurtures your growth, while extra Metal reinforces your core strength. By embracing Earth and Metal influences, you bolster your resolve and foundation, helping you act with greater decisiveness and play to your strengths with assurance.</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>Wealth</h4><p>You\'re likely to receive help from mentors or benefactors in your career. When the winds of your industry shift favorably, you can soar to success on that breeze. Your best strategy for prosperity is to deepen your expertise: become so good in your field that your reputation attracts fortune. Avoid chasing quick profits or fads – schemes promising fast money could backfire for you. If you enter business partnerships, choose collaborators carefully and insist on shared values; not everyone will match your integrity and patience. Slow, principled growth will beat reckless ventures in the long run for you.</p><h4>Health</h4><p>Protect your lungs and respiratory system. Whenever possible, spend time in clean, fresh air (a walk in the park or a getaway to nature can work wonders). In smoggy or cold conditions, consider wearing a mask or scarf to shield yourself. Keep indoor air flowing and humidified to prevent respiratory issues. Maintain a moderate exercise routine to strengthen immunity, but be gentle with yourself – warm up thoroughly and cool down after workouts. Also fortify your bones and joints: get enough calcium and vitamin D, and avoid long periods of physical inactivity. These habits will help prevent the aches and strains an Attuned Metal type can be prone to.</p><h4>Emotional Wellbeing</h4><p>Your meticulous nature sometimes slips into perfectionism, making you prone to anxiety. You may lie awake rehashing mistakes or worrying about outcomes. To break this cycle, impose some structure on your day – a regular routine can soothe an overactive mind and give a sense of control. Additionally, find therapeutic outlets: activities that engage your body or creative mind without overthinking. For example, a sport like fencing channels focus into precise movements (and doubles as a stress reliever), while playing a musical instrument like the piano can be calming and expressive. These pursuits let you release tension and escape the perfectionist loop, restoring inner peace.</p><h4>Career Pathways</h4><p>Where You Flourish: Finance & Planning: Stable roles in banking, asset management, accounting or financial planning suit you. Your careful strategy and caution make you excellent at safeguarding and growing wealth in a methodical way. Quality Control & Tech Operations: You excel in positions like system administrator, quality assurance tester, or precision instrument engineer, where your attention to detail prevents errors and ensures everything runs like clockwork. Public Administration: Civil service or public sector jobs (government agencies, libraries, universities) and administrative roles are a natural fit. These structured environments reward your reliability and willingness to work steadily behind the scenes. Healthcare: Detail-oriented medical careers such as dentist, acupuncturist, lab technician (e.g. radiology tech), or pharmacist align with your cautious and thorough disposition. Patients trust your gentle, methodical care. Earth Sciences & Appraisal: Fields like geology, environmental science, or gemology (jewelry appraisal) tap into your patience and precision. You can become the go-to expert who meticulously assesses and plans for the long term. Education & Training: Teaching, especially in structured subjects (math, physics) or vocational skills training, allows you to impart knowledge in an organized way. You prepare diligently and can deeply influence those who learn under your guidance. Where Energy Feels Drained: High-Pressure Enforcement: Intense frontline roles in law enforcement or the military (like being a police officer, combat soldier, or high-powered trial lawyer) may be overwhelming. The constant high stakes and confrontations can rattle your peace of mind and clash with your low-key style. Unpredictable Creative Fields: Jobs in advertising, creative writing, or investigative journalism involve rapid changes, tight deadlines, and ambiguity. This instability could aggravate your tendency to worry and overanalyze, making you less effective and more stressed. Hospitality & Nightlife: The frenetic energy of running restaurants, bars, nightclubs, or working in tourism (with erratic schedules and nonstop socializing) can quickly drain you. These fields demand extroversion and quick pivots that might leave you exhausted. Agriculture & Gardening: While you appreciate stability, the largely uncontrollable aspects of farming, forestry, or horticulture (weather, pests, unpredictable yields) could prove frustrating. The heavy physical demands and lack of intellectual stimulation in these jobs might not satisfy you for long.</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Wu Earth: Surround yourself with friends who embody Wu Earth (steadfast Yang Earth) – their reliability and long-term outlook help calm your anxieties and keep you focused on your goals.</li><li>Xin Metal: Also connect with Xin Metal (refined Yin Metal) friends; their sharp insight and finesse inspire you to be more decisive and provide level-headed advice when you\'re in doubt.</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Wu Earth: A Wu Earth partner offers patience and solidity, giving you a safe harbor and emotional stability when you feel uncertain. They help ground your life, smoothing out worries.</li><li>Xin Metal: Meanwhile, a Xin Metal partner will intuitively understand your thought process and share in your growth. Together you can form a thoughtful power-couple – just be mindful to soften any tendencies for both of you to dig in stubbornly during conflicts.</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Sir Tim Berners‑Lee: Inventor of the World Wide Web. A visionary yet humble engineer, he revolutionized global information sharing through careful planning and quietly changed the world</li><li>Muhammad Ali: Boxing legend renowned not just for his power but for his strategy and wit in the ring. Later in life, he devoted himself to humanitarian causes like Parkinson\'s research and interfaith dialogue</li><li>Paul Newman: Oscar‑winning actor who was as famous for his cool, measured performances as he was for his later philanthropic ventures</li><li>Emma Watson: Actress and UN Women Goodwill Ambassador. Known for her intelligent, poised advocacy of girls\' education and equality</li><li>Henry Ford: Pioneering industrialist who transformed manufacturing with the assembly line</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Dong Mingzhu: Powerful businesswoman and chair of Gree Electric. Renowned for her no-nonsense, strategic leadership style</li><li>Yuan Longping: Revered agronomist dubbed the \'Father of Hybrid Rice.\' With patient research and innovation, he solved critical food security problems</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_dailyTips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Keep a ceramic ornament (like a small vase or figurine) on your desk or in your living space. Earth-element ceramics provide a grounding influence</li><li>Wear a bit of metal each day – whether it\'s a watch, jewelry, or even metallic fabric – to reinforce your inherent Metal energy</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>White (Metal): White symbolizes clarity and decisiveness. It can strengthen your resolve and give you a sense of poise, like a freshly polished blade ready for action. Use white accessories or clothing (a shirt, a phone case, a notepad) to add a layer of crisp confidence to your day.</li><li>Yellow (Earth): Yellow represents stability and a strong foundation. It nurtures a feeling of being grounded and supported. Incorporate gentle yellow tones in your environment – perhaps a coffee mug, a pair of socks, or a piece of decor – to help you feel centered and steady, especially when you\'re facing important decisions.</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Center (Earth): Spend time at the heart of things – literally and figuratively. Sitting in the middle of a room or being centrally involved in a project taps the Earth energy of the center. This position brings you protection and learning opportunities, making it easier to receive recognition or mentorship from higher-ups. If you can\'t physically be centered, imagine yourself drawing strength from the center of the Earth during meditation.</li><li>West (Metal): The west is your power direction. It resonates with Metal energy, which amplifies your confidence and resolve. Facing west when working or meditating, or placing important symbols (like your vision board or career awards) on the western side of your space, can attract strong support from colleagues and friends. The West\'s influence boosts peer and team assistance, directly strengthening your abilities.</li></ul>']]], 'zh' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>庚金为刀剑之金，身弱力量有限，但仍具备深思熟虑的能力和前瞻性的谋划。身弱庚金不必盲目追求世俗锋芒，而应在擅长的领域成为无可替代的问题终结者。</p><p>谦和谨慎：外显低调谦和，处事细致谨慎，善于权衡利弊，但需防止过度思虑错失良机。<br/>刚直坚守：内在刚直有骨气，遇原则性问题寸步不让，常因理想与现实冲突陷入矛盾。<br/>细腻敏感：情感细腻重诺，防备心强，需要长期磨合才能真正敞开心扉。</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>身弱庚金，喜用神为土、金。庚金如初铸之钢，身弱时力量不足，容易缺乏果断与稳定。</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>财富运势</h4><p>有贵人帮扶，等对风口事业一波起飞。宜深耕专业领域积累口碑，避免投机或快钱陷阱。</p><h4>健康隐患</h4><p>保护肺部健康，尽量待在空气清新的地方；预防呼吸道炎症；预防筋骨劳损。</p><h4>情绪管理</h4><p>易陷入完美主义焦虑，可通过规律作息、击剑/弹琴释放压力。</p><h4>职业管理</h4><p>推荐行业：金融投资：证券投资、基金管理、金融咨询。法律：律师事务所、法律顾问、法院工作。审计：财务审计、内控审核、风险评估。机械制造：精密制造、机械设计、设备制造。精密仪器：医疗器械、精密仪器、测量设备。物流：物流管理、仓储配送、供应链管理。水利工程：水资源管理、水利建设、水务管理。器械制造：医疗器械、机械制造、精密器械。慎重行业：农业种植：农场经营、农产品、农业合作社。陶艺制作：陶瓷工艺、手工艺品、艺术创作。仓储管理：仓库管理、物流仓储、供应链管理。重工业流水线：重工业制造、自动化生产、工业生产。金属矿产开采：采矿业、矿产开发、地质勘探。竞技体育：职业运动员、体育竞技、高风险运动。</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>戊土：戊土踏实可靠，擅长长远规划，帮助你缓解焦虑、专注目标。</li><li>辛金：辛金可激发你的决断力和行动力。辛金细致敏锐，能在关键时刻提供理性建议。</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>戊土：包容性强，能稳定情绪与生活根基。</li><li>辛金：彼此理解，共同成长但需避免固执对立。</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Tim Berners-Lee：互联网之父，发明万维网，推动全球信息自由共享</li><li>Muhammad Ali：拳击史上最伟大运动员之一，晚年致力帕金森病研究与跨宗教对话</li><li>Paul Newman：奥斯卡影帝</li><li>Emma Watson：演员，联合国妇女署亲善大使，资助非洲与南亚女童教育项目</li><li>Henry Ford：汽车工业革命者，首创流水线生产</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>董明珠：格力电器董事长</li><li>袁隆平：\'杂交水稻之父\'，解决全球粮食安全问题</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_dailyTips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>可以在桌子上摆放陶瓷摆件</li><li>佩戴金属配饰</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>白色（金）：白色象征清晰与决断，能增强魄力。</li><li>黄色（土）：黄色象征稳固与根基，能帮助庚金建立内在稳定感。</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>土（中央）：这个方位能给您带来庇护、学习和成长的机会。</li><li>西方（金）：能获得同辈、朋友、同事的支持和帮助。</li></ul>']]]], 'version' => 1];
